    { "Shows a window listing the last 32 Course Edit changes.\nClick a row to undo or redo back to it. Ctrl+Z undoes and\nCtrl+Y redoes with or without the panel.", "Muestra una ventana con los últimos 32 cambios de Course Edit.\nToca una fila para deshacer o rehacer hasta ella." },
